@bio:

Henning Burghoff is a master's student in musicology at the
University of Vienna, following a BA completed in 2025. He
also pursued studies in computer science (Vienna) and
linguistics (Potsdam). Since 2023, he has been a student
assistant on the E-LAUTE project, where he edits and
transcribes tablatures and develops automation tools.

@@END: BIO